# Streaming native AArch64 compact code word position ledger
# Each input character uses presence marker one then its raw byte
# Source instructions are classified by standard Brainfuck only
# Native word positions use sixteen base sixteen counter digits
# Open bracket emits tag one and eight native word position bytes
# Close bracket emits tag two and eight native word position bytes
# Final tag three carries the exact native code length in words
# Termination emits zero then arithmetic overflow status
